  <title><xmlelement>lcAnswerOptionGroup2</xmlelement></title>
  <shortdesc>The <xmlelement>lcAnswerOptionGroup2</xmlelement> element provides a container for
    the options for a true-false, single-select, or multiple-select assessment interaction. This
